# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values — .env is git-ignored,
# this template isn't. Only EXPO_PUBLIC_-prefixed vars get inlined into
# the app bundle, and these are the only two the client actually reads
# (see lib/supabase.ts) — nothing else needs to go in here. In
# particular, there is no EXPO_PUBLIC_LIVEKIT_URL: the client gets its
# LiveKit connection URL at runtime from the livekit-token Edge Function's
# response (lib/livekit.ts), not from a build-time env var.
#
# Get these from Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → API, for
# whichever project you're pointing this local run at (dev/preview vs.
# production use different projects — see README.md section 2).

EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key
